id: intervene
name: Intervene
type: counter
actionCost: 1
kiCost: 0
attacking: false
intervene: true
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Step in the way of danger to help an ally. Played when an Ally who is not at
  Long Range is hit by an Attacking Maneuver; the effect chosen sets the Ki cost.
  The first Counter Maneuver that can be used without being the target.

---
